 style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          这一只，其实是两个批次L2和L24，他们是相同处理方式的两个小批次，测的时候感觉它两很相似，都有柑橘调性，拼在一起后入口是类似红色花朵的花香和红色莓果核果的果香，中后段特别有意思，它会有一种吃柠檬+柚子橙子的酸转甜，那个尾端的生津甜感很特别，它们也会进入我们的Pacamara手冲拼配的新组成中～\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SHFAXvibdx4K5wz2KSBEPRjnVqIKTBvbkapallJJ77Rib1BxJenz5dj9Dfjiapjuw8QWH2tw6plxqSQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          处理过程：\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          鲜果采收筛选后，脱皮后放入发酵罐，添加Kveik Voss酵母（可能还有乳酸菌），控制温度环境下厌氧发酵（具体时间还不确定，从官方Ins和其他资料查到的线索来看是2-7天之间），发酵结束后取出咖啡豆清洗，然后晒床自然晾晒；\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n           关于Santos Cafe\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          1947年，Don Ismael Lezcano 抵达奇里基省的圣克拉拉；在他 18 个孩子的帮助下，他们开发了一个种植豆类、咖啡、甘蔗、玉米和牛的农场；而我们的主人公Don Santos Lezcano就是18个孩子之一，第二代咖农，开创了现在的桑托斯庄园，到现在Lezcano家族已经是第五代了；\n         </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SHFAXvibdx4K5wz2KSBEPRjiccRrJrVr9ydCVcibVwx6leuvCFA5Kk4HHr0hr09xE20XjzcEkyQZeIw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          Don Santos，第二代咖农，农场的老法师，2021年91岁时的照片\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          桑托斯庄园总占地 55 公顷，有两个农场Finca Bartolo和La Mimada用来种植不同的品种；Bartolo种植卡杜拉 (Caturra) 和卡图艾 (Catuai) ，面向大宗基础用豆，最开始是面向巴拿马本地市场的咖啡需求的，也是家族从Santos老爷爷时代就开始种植的地方，海拔相对低一些，介于1100-1400米；La Mimada是更高海拔，家族后期购入的用于种植更好的一些精品品种，面向精品市场需求的，目前有种植卡杜拉，Pacamara，黄波旁和瑰夏，并且大部分的实验方式/批次都是来自于Mimada；\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FGr457cyFia7SHFAXvibdx4K5wz2KSBEPRjdaPseIsVvVNicQEib6EewicvgGepygE8L8yoGeBOw48LAtQW7IGxHFhug%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_3595085373405216778\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_3595085373405216778\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-w=\"720\" frameborder=\"0\" style=\"border-radius: 4px;\">\n</iframe>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          视频来源：Santos庄园的Ins，这个是Mimada的航拍\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FGr457cyFia7SHFAXvibdx4K5wz2KSBEPRjqFz4nWGOXOPOWgzZN1ibnRRiaHicvKSqw9T6K31nkfiaFq0hicm2GIELgibQ%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_3595079114916446209\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_3595079114916446209\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-w=\"720\" frameborder=\"0\" style=\"border-radius: 4px;\">\n</iframe>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;text-align: center;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n          La Mimada的Gesha种植情况\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FGr457cyFia7SHFAXvibdx4K5wz2KSBEPRjQricVwoGpkeuXZJkbjKIsEnFDnValPOjbGWfeGckHTT0zMdBia5MySxw%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_3595090814877122560\" data-ratio=\"0.8\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_3595090814877122560\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-w=\"720\" frameborder=\"0\" style=\"border-radius: 4px;\">\n</iframe>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          视频来源：Santos的Ins，瑰夏的采摘\n         </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SHFAXvibdx4K5wz2KSBEPRjGNssFfhvIS1QjjjPVian22z1NuFrye8EXOY674eT2oWfR7bbPegpiaOg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          Santos种植的Red Pacamara和Yellow Pacamara\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n           参考资源：\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<a data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/santos.cafe/?locale=\">\n           https://www.instagram.com/santos.cafe/?locale=\n          </a>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n          <img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
